    "detailed_description": "<strong>Harvest &amp; Chill</strong><br>Explore the islands, harvesting &amp; delivering a variety of crops, while relaxing in the stress-free environments of the islands. Control small vehicles, interact with the tiny world and keep those pesky animals away from your harvest!<br><br><strong>Pick Fruit</strong><br>Collect a variety of fruits, vegetables and harvests to fulfil your quotas and deliver food from each island.<br><br><strong>Deal with Animals</strong><br>Rabbits and birds may try to block your harvesting skills so make sure you distract them before they cause you problems!<br><br><strong>Gather stuff in tiny worlds</strong><br>Discover hidden objects in the islands in unique locations to reveal more about the cartoon-inspired worlds. Each island is hand-crafted, designed to make exploring the game\u2019s worlds as fun as possible.<br><br><strong>Over 70 Levels</strong><br>Spread across 5 worlds, and a variety of seasons, progress through the islands unlocking new challenges as you go!<br><br>----<br><br>Gather was developed as part of \u2018Game Develop Month\u2019 a community game jam challenging game developers to build a complete game in one month.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Harvest &amp; Chill</strong><br>Explore the islands, harvesting &amp; delivering a variety of crops, while relaxing in the stress-free environments of the islands. Control small vehicles, interact with the tiny world and keep those pesky animals away from your harvest!<br><br><strong>Pick Fruit</strong><br>Collect a variety of fruits, vegetables and harvests to fulfil your quotas and deliver food from each island.<br><br><strong>Deal with Animals</strong><br>Rabbits and birds may try to block your harvesting skills so make sure you distract them before they cause you problems!<br><br><strong>Gather stuff in tiny worlds</strong><br>Discover hidden objects in the islands in unique locations to reveal more about the cartoon-inspired worlds. Each island is hand-crafted, designed to make exploring the game\u2019s worlds as fun as possible.<br><br><strong>Over 70 Levels</strong><br>Spread across 5 worlds, and a variety of seasons, progress through the islands unlocking new challenges as you go!<br><br>----<br><br>Gather was developed as part of \u2018Game Develop Month\u2019 a community game jam challenging game developers to build a complete game in one month.",
    "short_description": "Harvest crops, pick fruit and collect vegetables all while investigating and exploring a series of tiny islands along the way. Discover secrets hidden in the islands while relaxing and gathering a variety of objects along the way.",
